# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: To the Undercity for Yagyin's Digest (728), News for Fizzle (1137).

# The Badlands at 39-40, the last zone of Horde 30-40 (the 2026-11-07 re-order; they followed
# Arathi at 37-38 before, and the route went back to Stranglethorn, Orgrimmar and Dustwallow
# from Kargath).
#
# Flow: Faldir's Cove (where the previous guide ends) -> the Thandol Span, the Wetlands and
# Loch Modan -> the Valley of Fangs (Martek, Rigglefuzz) -> Lotwil's camp -> Kargath (flight
# path) -> the lesser rock elementals -> Lotwil -> the coyotes and buzzards -> the slabs
# by Agmond's End -> Agmond's End -> the Stonevault troggs -> the Valley of Fangs -> the Uldaman
# dig -> Agmond's End -> Lotwil -> Kargath, from where the next guide flies to Grom'gol.
#
# The slabs come from the Rock Elementals beside Agmond's End, and Lotwil takes them on the way
# back to Kargath (2026-11-09 audit): no walk back to his camp from the basin in between. Left
# out: his third study (712, bracers from the level 42-44 Greater Rock Elementals) and Lucien's
# Stone Is Better than Cloth after it (716, crafted bracers).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into the Badlands

step Into the Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Head for the Thandol Span, the great bridge at Arathi's southern edge, cross it and follow the road south through the Wetlands to the Dun Algaz tunnel into Loch Modan. Thelsamar, the dwarf town on the road in the middle of Loch Modan, has guards who attack the Horde: leave the road before it and pass the town on the hills to its west. The road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands; follow it to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs.
  goto 42.3,52.8 "Valley of Fangs"

step Into Wetlands
  zone Wetlands
  goto 51.1,12.0 "Into Wetlands"

step Into Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 25.6,10.5 "Into Loch Modan"

step Into Badlands
  zone Badlands
  goto 49.4,8.0 "Into Badlands"

step To Valley of Fangs
  zone Badlands
  goto 42.2,52.7 "To Valley of Fangs"

step Valley of Fangs
  getfp "Kargath"
  turnin 1106 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Martek the Exiled: Fizzle's letter from the Shimmering Flats
  accept 1108 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  accept 703 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rigglefuzz

step The Dustbowl
  tip Head west along the road towards Kargath; Lotwil's camp sits in the Dustbowl halfway there.
  accept 710 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Lotwil Veriatus

step Kargath
  tip Kargath is the Horde fortress built into the cliffs at the zone's western edge. Neeka Bloodscar stands on Kargath's upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart.
  accept 1419 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Neeka Bloodscar
  accept 2258 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Jarkal Mossmeld, inside
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Around the Dustbowl

step Lesser Rock Elementals
  tip The small elementals drift across the flats between Kargath and Lotwil's camp, on the road back east. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop Jarkal's Rock Elemental Shards.
  collect 4626 quest 710 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 710 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  accept 711 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south
step Apocryphan's Rest: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the Dustbowl. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; the Giant Buzzards drop the gizzards. Careful: Malevolent Mirages (42, elite) drift across the Badlands: give them a wide berth.
  tip Careful: the Giant Buzzards are 39-41, and the 41s are two over you at 39: pick the 39s and 40s and pull them one at a time. The Buzzards (37) you kill later for Rigglefuzz's wings drop gizzards too, more rarely.
  collect 7848 quest 2258.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 6166 quest 1419 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 7846 quest 2258.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 7847 quest 2258.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Badlands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip South-east across the basin, the bigger Rock Elementals (39) stand on the slopes west of Agmond's End; each one drops a slab. Every rock elemental can drop Jarkal's Rock Elemental Shards. Careful: Malevolent Mirages (42, elite) drift across these slopes too.
  collect 7848 quest 2258.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 4627 quest 711 @40.4,77.1 map 1418 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Agmond's End
  when group 709
  tip Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at Agmond's End, just east of the elementals. His tablet lies just inside Uldaman's cave mouth, beside level 38 elites: a quest for a group.
  accept 709

step Agmond's End: kill these as you meet them
  zone Badlands
  tip The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the Valley of Fangs, on the way north from Agmond's End; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes. The Buzzards for Rigglefuzz's wings circle the hills between the Valley of Fangs and Agmond's End.
  collect 3404 quest 703 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 5797 quest 1108 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Valley of Fangs
  tip The road north to Uldaman runs through the Valley of Fangs: Rigglefuzz and Martek take the wings and the flakes on the way.
  turnin 703 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rigglefuzz
  turnin 1108 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1137 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- for Fizzle at the Mirage Raceway, on the way from Freewind Post to Tanaris around level 43

step Ancient Chest
  when group 709
  tip Keep north on the road to Uldaman's entrance, in the north of the Badlands: the chest lies just inside the cave mouth. Magregan Deepshadow and the Obsidian Golems (38) stand beside it and Shadowforge Diggers (35-36) work the tunnel, all elite: keep your group together.
  collect 4631 quest 709              -- Below ground

step Agmond's End
  when group 709
  tip Head back south down the road, past the Valley of Fangs.
  turnin 709                          -- Theldurin the Lost

step The Dustbowl
  tip North-west across the basin to Lotwil's camp. Short of Jarkal's shards? The Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of the camp drop them about one kill in five.
  turnin 711 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Lotwil Veriatus
  note Lotwil's next study wants bracers from the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44) in the south-western gulches, well above you: leave it.

step Kargath
  tip Head west back to Kargath. Neeka Bloodscar stands on Kargath's upper level, high above the flight master: take the ramps up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart.
  turnin 1419 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Neeka Bloodscar
  turnin 2258 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Jarkal Mossmeld, inside
  note The next guide flies from Kargath to Grom'gol.

